flowchart TD
    A[Start Script] --> B[Read Parameters: Mailbox, OutputFile, ExportPath]
    B --> C{ExportPath Provided?}
    C -- No --> D[Set ExportPath to default UNC path \\exchange.coda.com\pst\<Mailbox>.pst]
    C -- Yes --> E[Use Provided ExportPath]
    D --> F[Get-MailboxFolderStatistics for Mailbox]
    E --> F
    F --> G[Filter Folders: FolderType is User Created or Archive]
    G --> H[Exclude Known System and Unwanted Folders such as Outbox, Sync Issues, Junk Email]
    H --> I{Any Folders Left?}
    I -- No --> J[Output message No folders found and Exit]
    I -- Yes --> K[Trim Leading Slash from Folder Paths]
    K --> L[Wrap Folder Names in Double Quotes]
    L --> M[Join Folder Names with Commas]
    M --> N[Build Export Command using New-MailboxExportRequest]
    N --> O[Write Export Command to Output File]
    O --> P[Build Remove Command for completed export jobs]
    P --> Q[Create Remove Output File Name with word Remove before extension]
    Q --> R[Write Remove Command to Remove Output File]
    R --> S[Display Both Commands on Screen]
    S --> T[End Script]
